# NOTICE — PI Blender Bridge (candidate)

This package is a **host adaptation**, not a rewrite. It carries upstream source
and upstream-derived artifacts verbatim and adds a thin PI-Desktop boundary.
License boundaries are listed per directory; a file is only under the license of
the directory it lives in.

