## BSD-3-Clause (Copyright (c) 2026, sixtyseven67)

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `vendor/source/runtime/**` | Upstream gateway/runtime TypeScript (350 files), the host-plugin half; BSD per upstream LICENSE |
