## PI-Desktop SDK

No PI-Desktop SDK code is vendored or shipped. The official devkit
(`@pi-desktop/plugin-devkit`) is used **at build time only** to produce and
validate the `.piplug`; it is not part of the package and not a runtime
dependency.

